    "body": "fix on issue/1303-tilt-band-dip · PR #1306 (draft, stacked on #973) · pinned by `tilt_band_dip` (app: clean at small tilts, a rim in the part convicts 0.6 to 60 degrees, monotone across the tolerance, the mid-turn sweep) and the `verify::tilt_band` unit tests (4000-case containment property, limits, the (c2) column) · merges when reviewed\n\nOne helper (`verify::tilt_band::lean`) now builds the tilted column for laws (c), (c3), (c2) and (d2); the z planes stand at the band's true lowest and highest points (foot -/+ R·sin θ). Moved verdicts: #938's `tilt_tolerance.rs` cliff pin only. The posed capsule sweep keeps the same cliff in the fixture verdict: #1305.\n",
